  - Oh, you're an interviewee?
  - Perfect, make sure to sign this NDA before you go forward
  - 'MidaCorp tm is an official business under the MegaCorpo tm Brand, and as such
    has the liability features as other locations under MegaCorpo tm. This includes
    multiple tasks for the signer of this document, including: Arriving to shift
    hours on time, Living in MegaCorpo tm facilities, and servicing any and all tasks
    assigned to this worker. Any and all harm that may come onto this worker will
    not be covered by MegaCorpo, and instead any hospital bills will be taken in
    a biweekly split with their checks.'
  - Oh also, I'm closing the gate behind you, I don't want to die.
